      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean that's a pretty safe answer lol. but if u look at recent history, doesn't it feel like they're mostly just used by the west to punish countries they don't like, rather than actually helping people gain freedom? it seems like the \"pressure\" mostly just hurts regular people while the leaders stay fine.",
